# Internationalization

See `docs/agents/i18n.md` for full conventions.

- Always add keys to both `i18n/locales/de.json` and `i18n/locales/en.json`
- German is the default/source locale — nested keys grouped by feature area
- No hardcoded UI strings in components — use `t("key")` from `useI18n()`
